{"unit_id":"suufon__dsh-429-guard#card-zh","repo":"suufon/dsh-429-guard","commit":"05361891d3cfa7b6218bfb7da9bc81222fd56459","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-429-guard 是 DSH Web 插件，为模型请求遇到 429 限流或配额不足时提供自动重试，并在 Web 界面右上角显示可拖动的守卫浮窗。它监听 agent/request-error 事件，识别 RATE_LIMIT、QUOTA、HTTP 429 及相关错误文案，等待退避间隔后让 agent 重新请求；浮窗可开关守卫、设置次数或时长上限、查看重试统计并清零。适合希望长任务在限流后继续运行的 DSH Web 用户。状态和统计保存在 DSH_HOME 下的本地存储文件，不需要额外 API key。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:164-247","lib/client.js:676-737"]}
{"unit_id":"suufon__dsh-429-guard#card-en","repo":"suufon/dsh-429-guard","commit":"05361891d3cfa7b6218bfb7da9bc81222fd56459","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-429-guard is a DSH Web plugin that retries model requests after rate-limit or quota errors. It adds a draggable widget for toggling retries, setting retry limits, viewing statistics, and clearing counts. It stores state locally under DSH_HOME and needs no extra API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:164-247","lib/client.js:676-737"]}
