{"unit_id":"suufon__dsh-429-guard#feature-1","repo":"suufon/dsh-429-guard","commit":"05361891d3cfa7b6218bfb7da9bc81222fd56459","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-429-guard 的功能「429 自动重试」：开启守卫后，模型请求遇到限流或配额类错误会按退避间隔等待，再交由 agent 重新请求；等待过程可被停止信号取消。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:164-168","lib/index.js:241-247"]}
