{"unit_id":"suufon__dsh-429-guard#feature-3","repo":"suufon/dsh-429-guard","commit":"05361891d3cfa7b6218bfb7da9bc81222fd56459","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-429-guard 的功能「重试状态面板」：Web 浮窗显示守卫开关、累计重试、最近拦截和错误状态，并提供清零统计的操作。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:606-674","lib/client.js:705-713"]}
